Tevatron (vendored)
===================

This directory contains a small subset of source files vendored from the
Tevatron neural retrieval toolkit, used as the base classes for our LLaDA 2
retrieval training integration:

    _base_arguments.py  <- tevatron/src/tevatron/retriever/arguments.py
    _base_trainer.py    <- tevatron/src/tevatron/retriever/trainer.py
    _base_encoder.py    <- tevatron/src/tevatron/retriever/modeling/encoder.py

Upstream project:
    Name:    Tevatron
    URL:     https://github.com/texttron/tevatron
    License: Apache License, Version 2.0
             http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Modifications relative to upstream are limited to:
    * Rewriting the package-internal imports (`tevatron.retriever.*`,
      `from .modeling import ...`) to refer to the locally vendored
      `_base_*` modules.
    * Adding this header / NOTICE file.

